\[R_{\rm AA}=\frac{\sigma_{\rm NN}}{\langle N_{\rm coll}\rangle}\frac{d^{2}N_{ \rm AA}/d\,p_{\rm T}d\eta}{d^{2}\sigma_{pp}/d\,p_{\rm T}d\eta}, \tag{5}\]

