\[\epsilon_{\rm EnergyLoss}=\frac{d\,N/dp_{\rm T}^{\rm RC(reconstructed)}}{d\,N/dp_{ \rm T}^{\rm MC(reconstructed)}}, \tag{4.8}\]

which includes the effects from both the residual energy loss and finite momentum resolution.

